      "text_source_state": "human_verified",
      "text": "Producers of a popular ghost hunting YouTube channel called Spektral Krew are planning to illegally visit Isola di Malamente, an island off the coast of Sicily to broadcast live as they attempt to uncover evidence of a genuine haunting and thus become Internet sensations. All goes well until they find that their ride off the island has disappeared and they begin to see more than dust orbs and incoherently blurred photos. They soon learn that there may be someone or something... else on the island, and that the history of the place may be darker than they could have ever imagined.",
