      "text_source_state": "human_verified",
      "text": "This scenario involves a group of professional ghost hunters traveling to a mysterious island to spend the night searching for evidence of the supernatural. While some of them are certainly interested in finding actual evidence for ghosts, their real objective is to 'go viral' on YouTube in order to bring their channel to the next level and perhaps even hit the big time with their own television show. Unbeknownst to the Investigators, a cult of the Great Old One Hastalÿk has been active on the island since the Bronze",
      "heading_level": null,
      "source_block_id": "P006-B002",
      "span_ids": [
        "P006-B002-S005"
      ],
      "review_state": "ready_for_review",
